<title>USA: Interlake Corp Q4 operating income rises.</title>
<headline>Interlake Corp Q4 operating income rises.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	  $0.23		    $0.05</p>
<p> Oper net		    7,347		    1,694</p>
<p> Revs			195,665		  172,961</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 31,670		   30,520</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income, including income from discontinued operations, was $49.185 million for the fourth quarter 1996 versus $2.802 million for the quarter in 1995.  </p>
<p>				   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.24		    $0.03</p>
<p> Oper net		    7,525			993</p>
<p> Revs			709,585		  689,913</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 31,670		   30,520</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income, including extraordinary items and income from discontinued operations, was $55.244 million for the full year 1996 versus $765,000 for 1995.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
